{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/haus-of-tenet-irth-development-business-bay","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1388,"crm_id":"7345","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Haus Of Tenet","slug":"haus-of-tenet-irth-development-business-bay","display_address":"Business Bay","building_type":["offices"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"Irth Development","price":null,"display_price":"TBA","lattitude":25.178327528019,"longitude":55.269406271959,"min_bedrooms":0,"max_bedrooms":0,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Haus of Tenet by IRTH is a branded, art-led commercial development that represents a clear shift in how office ownership is positioned in Dubai. The project is conceived as a long-term institutional address rather than a conventional commercial building. Every aspect of the development is shaped around authorship, permanence, and cultural value, making it particularly relevant for founders, family offices, and leadership-led enterprises.</p><p>Located in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/business-bay/\">Business Bay</a>, the project introduces an integrated art ecosystem that goes beyond aesthetics. A curated in-house gallery, annual art auctions, and a shared art ownership program are embedded into the building’s common spaces, with the initial investment fully borne by the developer. Offices are delivered in shell-and-core condition and organized through a semi-private cluster model, allowing owners to expand over time without relocating. This deliberate combination of architecture, art, and ownership structure positions Haus of Tenet in Business Bay as a differentiated commercial asset built for long-term relevance.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_ab429c889a.jpg","hash":"Feature_ab429c889a","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_ae67a393a0.jpg","hash":"Banner_ae67a393a0","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_7_5cfce65999.jpg","hash":"Gallery_7_5cfce65999","name":"Gallery-7.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_1_4fb62f95a6.jpg","hash":"Gallery_1_4fb62f95a6","name":"Gallery-1.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_2_729714de8a.jpg","hash":"Gallery_2_729714de8a","name":"Gallery-2.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_3_959c1b28b3.jpg","hash":"Gallery_3_959c1b28b3","name":"Gallery-3.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_5_f135f216e9.jpg","hash":"Gallery_5_f135f216e9","name":"Gallery-5.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_8_8400499c58.jpg","hash":"Gallery_8_8400499c58","name":"Gallery-8.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_4_85d6777833.jpg","hash":"Gallery_4_85d6777833","name":"Gallery-4.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_6_f2e36a430d.jpg","hash":"Gallery_6_f2e36a430d","name":"Gallery-6.jpg"}],"images":null,"characteristics_module":{"id":2009,"cta":{"id":2839,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Find out more","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Selling_Point_5e0a516046.jpg","hash":"Selling_Point_5e0a516046","name":"Selling-Point.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"A Curated Collection of Branded Offices","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Branded Commercial Development - Haus of Tenet by IRTH &nbsp;is a purpose-built, fully branded office project authored entirely by the developer, marking a strategic shift toward long-term institutional commercial assets.</li><li>Prime Business Bay Positioning - Located within Dubai’s established enterprise district, offering direct access to Downtown Dubai, major arterial roads, and the Dubai Canal business corridor.</li><li>Art as Embedded Asset Value - A curated art program is integrated into shared spaces at Haus of Tenet offices in Dubai, including a dedicated gallery and annual auctions, positioning cultural capital as part of the ownership experience.</li><li>Developer-Funded Art Ownership Program - Shared ownership in a professionally curated art collection, fully funded by the developer with no upfront cost to buyers.</li><li>Flexible Ownership Structure - Haus of Tenets offices in Dubai are arranged in semi-private clusters, allowing independent ownership with the option to expand by combining units over time.</li><li>Multiple Office Typologies - A choice of Classic, Terrace, and Garden offices, alongside full-floor and half-floor options, addressing different operational and spatial requirements.</li><li>Executive-Level Privacy &amp; Access - Dedicated valet drop-off, exclusive lobbies, controlled lift access, and members-only amenities designed for senior leadership environments.</li><li>Friendly Payment Plan - A 50/50 payment schedule extending through construction and completion, supporting capital planning and financing flexibility.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2010,"cta":{"id":2840,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_Location_1910dc0044.jpg","hash":"Map_Location_1910dc0044","name":"Map-Location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Positioned in Dubai’s Primary Business Corridor","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"le